stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> WAIT_HEADER1
    WAIT_HEADER1 --> WAIT_HEADER2: 0xAA
    WAIT_HEADER2 --> WAIT_LEN: 0x55
    WAIT_HEADER2 --> WAIT_HEADER1: 非0x55(重同步)
    WAIT_LEN --> WAIT_TYPE: 长度合法
    WAIT_LEN --> WAIT_HEADER1: 长度越界
    WAIT_TYPE --> READ_PAYLOAD
    READ_PAYLOAD --> READ_PAYLOAD: 未收满
    READ_PAYLOAD --> WAIT_CRC_LO: 收满 LEN 字节
    WAIT_CRC_LO --> WAIT_CRC_HI
    WAIT_CRC_HI --> WAIT_HEADER1: CRC 对→交付/错→丢弃,都回起点
